338
00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:12.320
I know.
我知道。

339
00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:13.860
Sam, it's about the guitar.
萨姆，那是关于吉他的事。

340
00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.380
And I'm like, this is code for cake.
我当时心想，这肯定是蛋糕的暗号。

341
00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.480
They're messing with me.
她们在耍我。

342
00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:20.660
Angela, we officially apologize that there is no cake here.
安吉拉，我们正式向你道歉，这里确实没有蛋糕。

343
00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:23.900
I am going to see you tomorrow on your actual birthday
我明天会在你真正的生日那天见到你，

344
00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:27.300
