什么？

823
00:35:06.230 --> 00:35:10.550
What is the outcome of this, just to, like, flirt with Michael and make him feel good?
这会有什么结果？只是为了跟迈克尔调情，让他感觉良好吗？

824
00:35:10.550 --> 00:35:22.670
