00:35:35.850 --> 00:35:37.630
She goes into his office.
她走进他的办公室。

831
00:35:37.790 --> 00:35:39.690
She compliments his pants.
她夸了他的裤子。

832
00:35:39.690 --> 00:35:41.590
She compliments his tie.
她夸了他的领带。

833
00:35:41.950 --> 00:35:42.950
Hot tie guy.
戴领带的帅哥。

834
00:35:43.270 --> 00:35:44.650
Hot tie guy.
戴领带的帅哥。

835
00:35:44.870 --> 00:35:45.630
Hot tie guy.
戴领带的帅哥。

836
00:35:45.830 --> 00:35:53.910
And I love how excited Michael is to share that he got his tie for $4 and his pants for $9 at TJ Maxx.
我喜欢迈克尔分享他那条4美元的领带和9美元的裤子是在TJ Maxx买的时那种兴奋劲儿。

837
00:35:54.070 --> 00:35:54.910
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

