Oh, H-A-U-L.
哦，是H-A-U-L（战利品）。

855
00:36:39.710 --> 00:36:39.870
Yeah.
对。

856
00:36:39.870 --> 00:36:41.710
I thought you said, you know, those haul videos.
我以为你说的是那种“大厅（hall）”视频。

857
00:36:41.870 --> 00:36:44.330
