860
00:36:50.680 --> 00:36:51.080
No.
不是。

861
00:36:51.300 --> 00:36:51.880
Like, haul.
就是“战利品（haul）”。

862
00:36:52.020 --> 00:36:53.080
Like, here's my haul.
就像是，这是我的战利品。

863
00:36:53.240 --> 00:36:54.140
Here's what I got.
这是我买的东西。

864
00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:54.720
Yes.
没错。

865
00:36:54.840 --> 00:36:58.780
They would come home, and they would get their stuff out of their bags.
他们回家后，会把东西从袋子里拿出来。

866
00:36:58.940 --> 00:36:59.140
Yeah.
对。

867
00:36:59.380 --> 00:37:06.660
And it was sort of like the haul videos, because they would show every item, but part of the showing of the item would have to include-
这有点像那种开箱视频，因为他们会展示每一件商品，但展示商品的一部分内容必须包括——

