我只花了12美元买到。

871
00:37:16.200 --> 00:37:16.360
Yeah.
对。

872
00:37:16.660 --> 00:37:20.720
This shirt, this was 70% off at Ralph Lauren.
这件衬衫，在拉夫劳伦打三折。

873
00:37:20.720 --> 00:37:21.740
I got it for $12.
我只花了12美元。

874
00:37:22.400 --> 00:37:22.640
Yeah.
对。

875
00:37:22.900 --> 00:37:28.920
So the whole, like, description was always saying the price with the savings.
所以整个描述过程总是会提到价格和省下的钱。

876
00:37:29.160 --> 00:37:36.420
I think it was a big show for my dad, you know, so that he would feel better about any-
我觉得这对我爸来说是一场大戏，你知道，这样他会对任何——

877
00:37:36.420 --> 00:37:37.560
Well, your dad loves a deal.
嗯，你爸就喜欢捡便宜。

878
00:37:37.700 --> 00:37:38.520
He loves a deal.
他超爱捡便宜。

879
00:37:38.520 --> 00:37:39.680
This is what I know about him.
这是我对他了解的地方。

880
00:37:39.780 --> 00:37:40.200
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

881
00:37:40.200 --> 00:37:44.380
He wouldn't want my mom to buy a $12 shirt unless she could get it for $7.
他才不想让我妈买一件12美元的衬衫，除非她能以7美元买到。

882
00:37:44.640 --> 00:37:45.280
That's right.
没错。

883
00:37:45.560 --> 00:37:45.880
You know?
你知道吧？

884
00:37:46.120 --> 00:37:50.160
