00:38:11.500 --> 00:38:13.080
Michael's talking head in the script.
剧本里迈克尔的单人访谈。

895
00:38:13.320 --> 00:38:17.340
When people kiss up to you, it's very easy to get an inflated ego.
当人们拍你马屁时，很容易变得自负。

