00:38:17.580 --> 00:38:20.840
You can start to believe the hype that people are saying about you.
你会开始相信别人对你的吹捧。

897
00:38:21.080 --> 00:38:23.880
I'm not at that point yet, but I'm going to get there.
我还没到那个地步，但我会达到的。

898
00:38:23.880 --> 00:38:26.320
But I'm going to get there.
但我会达到的。

899
00:38:26.880 --> 00:38:28.100
That's pretty amazing.
那太棒了。

