Back at Shroot Farms, they are inside the farmhouse, and Angela and Dwight are arguing over what kind of butter sculpture she should have at the wedding.
回到施鲁特农场，他们在农舍里，安吉拉和德怀特正在争论婚礼上应该摆什么样的黄油雕塑。

