00:39:19.760 --> 00:39:22.400
And once again, we could not get through it.
再一次，我们没法顺利拍完。

917
00:39:22.540 --> 00:39:24.160
We were laughing so hard.
我们笑得太厉害了。

918
00:39:24.420 --> 00:39:26.620
It's in the deleted scenes on the DVD.
这在DVD的删减片段里。

