00:39:27.140 --> 00:39:30.560
I'm going to put it in stories, Jenna, because I had to cover my face.
珍娜，我要把它发到快拍里，因为我当时不得不捂住脸。

920
00:39:30.700 --> 00:39:31.820
I pull a Mindy.
我当时像明迪一样（忍不住笑场）。

921
00:39:31.960 --> 00:39:35.820
You can see me laughing with my hands over my face.
你能看到我双手捂脸在笑。

922
00:39:35.960 --> 00:39:42.060
But yes, then they get into this ridiculous argument about the sculpture, and that's what made it in the actual episode.
但没错，后来他们就雕塑展开了一场荒谬的争论，而那才是最终出现在正片里的内容。

923
00:39:42.060 --> 00:39:51.920
We got a fan question from Gabriela T., who said, Angela tells Dwight she wants a cat sculpture made out of cow butter for her wedding.
我们收到一个粉丝加布里埃拉·T的问题，她说，安吉拉告诉德怀特她婚礼上想要一个用牛油做的猫雕塑。

924
00:39:52.140 --> 00:39:53.440
I am from Iowa.
我来自爱荷华州。

