00:40:10.180 --> 00:40:11.000
I want to hear it.
我想听听。

930
00:40:11.000 --> 00:40:11.780
All right.
好的。

931
00:40:12.060 --> 00:40:17.000
So at the Iowa State Fair, every year they make a life-size cow out of butter.
在爱荷华州博览会上，他们每年都会用黄油制作一头等身大的牛。

