00:40:20.060 --> 00:40:20.460
Yeah.
没错。

936
00:40:20.620 --> 00:40:25.800
It starts with a frame of wood, metal, wire, and steel mesh.
制作时先用木头、金属、铁丝和钢网搭个架子。

937
00:40:25.980 --> 00:40:26.380
Okay.
好的。

938
